<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Riksbank says crown's equilibrium level ok. [CORRECTED 14:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Swedish Riksbank says crown's equilibrium level ok. [CORRECTED 14:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The deputy governor of Sweden's central bank, Lars Heikensten, said on Thursday the Riksbank still saw the crown's equilibrium level at 110-119 (corrects from 115-119) on the trade-weighted TCW index.</p>
</text>
